 return {\"total_carbohydrates\": -1}.\n\nExample:  \nText: \"I consumed 200g of cooked white rice and a 355ml can of regular cola.\"  \nResponse: {\"total_carbohydrates\": 100.8}\n\nExample (dilution):  \nText: \"I drank 250g of syrup water (syrup diluted with water, typical preparation).\"  \nResponse: {\"total_carbohydrates\": [estimate based on diluted syrup water per 250g]}\n\n# Prediction\nQuery: {{ text }}\nAnswer:",
