sponse: {\"total_carbohydrates\": 100.8}\n\nExample:\nText: \"I had 500g of water with 4g of sugar.\"\nResponse: {\"total_carbohydrates\": 4.00}\n\nOutput:\n\n# Prediction\nQuery: {{ text }}\nAnswer:"
